WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.961 --> 00:00:15.302
young woman held Mandy's arm tightly.

2
00:00:15.322 --> 00:00:21.244
"Miss Charlotte, you must not run away like that again," she said.

3
00:00:21.264 --> 00:00:27.367
"Excuse me," Mandy said, turning to look at the woman.

4
00:00:27.387 --> 00:00:29.808
"I'm not Charlotte."

5
00:00:31.928 --> 00:00:36.011
"Oh, you're not," the woman said, letting go.

6
00:00:37.353 --> 00:00:38.574
She started to cry.

7
00:00:44.298 --> 00:00:47.320
don't cry," Mandy said kindly.

8
00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.923
"Can I help you?"

9
00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:52.585
The woman shook her head.

10
00:00:53.846 --> 00:00:58.629
She wore a long black skirt and a black shawl over a long-sleeved blouse.

11
00:01:00.091 --> 00:01:01.492
A bonnet was on her head.

12
00:01:04.621 --> 00:01:08.444
"I'm Florence, Miss Charlotte's new nanny," she said.

13
00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:12.367
"We came here to watch the royal foot guards."

14
00:01:14.048 --> 00:01:15.089
"Look at that!"

15
00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:16.931
Vinnie interrupted them.

16
00:01:18.412 --> 00:01:23.275
Soldiers in red jackets and bearskin hats marched in front of the building.

17
00:01:24.476 --> 00:01:29.280
They were stepping very slowly, in perfect time with each other.

18
00:01:30.696 --> 00:01:34.618
Another group of soldiers marched just as slowly toward them.

19
00:01:34.638 --> 00:01:41.561
"It's the changing of the guards," Vinnie cried excitedly.

20
00:01:41.581 --> 00:01:48.643
"We're back in England, Mandy, and this must be Buckingham Palace!"

21
00:01:48.663 --> 00:01:53.025
"Quiet, Vinnie," whispered Mandy.

22
00:01:53.045 --> 00:01:56.006
"Florence is upset."

23
00:01:57.307 --> 00:02:00.813
Florence looked at Vinnie strangely, but continued.

24
00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:05.557
"Sometimes, Miss Charlotte likes to play tricks on me.

25
00:02:06.958 --> 00:02:08.759
She saw the crowd and ran off.

26
00:02:10.241 --> 00:02:15.405
I've been looking and looking cried Florence.

27
00:02:16.606 --> 00:02:19.008
She blew her nose into a handkerchief.

28
00:02:23.511 --> 00:02:25.813
"She was wearing a pink dress like you."

29
00:02:27.455 --> 00:02:28.896
The ceremony was over.

30
00:02:30.256 --> 00:02:36.422
Now, new guards stood in front of the palace, and the old guards were marching away.

31
00:02:37.743 --> 00:02:39.104
Florence wiped her eyes.

32
00:02:42.767 --> 00:02:43.688
must not give up.

33
00:02:45.009 --> 00:02:47.151
Miss Charlotte is probably close by."

34
00:02:47.171 --> 00:02:51.254
"We'll help you find her," said Mandy.

35
00:02:51.274 --> 00:02:53.156
"We will?"

36
00:02:53.717 --> 00:02:54.397
said Vinnie.

37
00:02:54.417 --> 00:03:01.613
"By the way, I'm Mandy, and this is my brother Vinnie," said Mandy.

38
00:03:01.633 --> 00:03:04.935
"Oh, thank you, Miss Mandy.

39
00:03:06.255 --> 00:03:08.016
But where is your nanny?"

40
00:03:08.676 --> 00:03:09.497
asked Florence.

41
00:03:10.797 --> 00:03:11.958
Mandy looked around.

42
00:03:13.238 --> 00:03:15.679
She and Vinnie were dressed very nicely.

43
00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.081
Some other children were dressed nicely too.

44
00:03:21.482 --> 00:03:24.523
They all walked with young women dressed like Florence.

45
00:03:25.923 --> 00:03:28.620
"We're just visiting," Mandy said quickly.

46
00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:31.601
"Is your family new to London?"

47
00:03:32.161 --> 00:03:32.741
she asked.

48
00:03:34.362 --> 00:03:36.222
The children looked at each other.

49
00:03:37.523 --> 00:03:40.584
They remembered their earlier photo trip to London.

50
00:03:40.604 --> 00:03:45.725
"It's only our second visit," Vinnie said truthfully.

51
00:03:45.745 --> 00:03:48.306
"We don't live here."

52
00:03:48.326 --> 00:03:53.227
"Well, I'm glad you're here," said Florence.

53
00:03:53.247 --> 00:03:56.628
"I would appreciate your help, thank you."

54
00:03:58.204 --> 00:04:00.846
The children followed Florence down the street.

55
00:04:01.987 --> 00:04:04.029
"Where do you think Charlotte would go?"

56
00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:05.370
asked Mandy.

57
00:04:07.192 --> 00:04:08.813
Florence thought for a moment.

58
00:04:08.833 --> 00:04:15.099
"Miss Charlotte has always wanted to see the Crystal Palace," she said.

59
00:04:15.119 --> 00:04:18.302
"That's where the Great Exhibition is."

60
00:04:18.322 --> 00:04:22.245
"That sounds interesting," said Mandy.

61
00:04:22.265 --> 00:04:25.528
"What kind of exhibition is it?"

62
00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:28.321
Florence smiled at her.

63
00:04:28.341 --> 00:04:34.464
"Let's start looking for Miss Charlotte there," she said.

64
00:04:34.484 --> 00:04:35.985
"It's not far."

65
00:04:37.286 --> 00:04:41.088
The children followed Florence, who headed quickly down the street.
